{"parentUuid":"628e5045-6092-4b98-ba19-b7918259541d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgGdoFg59zYKQpsxvQS4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2286,"cache_read_input_tokens":490845,"output_tokens":2813,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2286,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2813,"cache_read_input_tokens":490845,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2286,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2286},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgGdhUuSfbqyWFnmPqzX","type":"assistant","uuid":"1da379f6-11f4-4ee9-8d70-68f98f78b538","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:14:59.373Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
{"parentUuid":"1da379f6-11f4-4ee9-8d70-68f98f78b538","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgGdoFg59zYKQpsxvQS4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The verifiers **refuted 27 of 28 findings** — and they're right. Every \"root cause\" I just wrote into that plan is present in the winners too, often worse:\n\n| my claimed root cause | winner control |\n|---|---|\n| bodies have no line numbers | **20/20 instances** — 6/6 winners, including the biggest wins |\n| impact blind-chained to rank-1 | off-gold-file target in **7/12 winners**; the two largest wins have it in *more* degenerate form |\n| query polluted by issue boilerplate | 2/6 control winners have boilerplate queries producing boilerplate top hits |\n| hits out of score order | 5/20 payloads — includes winners lucene (−52%) and vuejs (−24%) |\n| line-less fabricated `server.h` caller | redis-10095 (+65) **and valkey-1842 (−21%, a winner)** |\n| `eg-q.run` path exposed in prompt | 20/20 |\n\nOnly one survived — the GOMODCACHE leak — and the verifier notes it explains a *winner* (caddy's baseline read the fix out of the module cache), not a loss.\n\nSo the tool is **equally broken everywhere**, and payload quality is not what decides the sign. That kills the plan I just wrote, and it's the winner-control gate I built into the workflow doing its job on my own reasoning.\n\nWhich leaves one structural lever: eg's post-edit floor of ~10 ops. Let me ask the old data whether any config ever got that floor lower:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2286,"cache_read_input_tokens":490845,"output_tokens":2813,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2286,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2813,"cache_read_input_tokens":490845,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2286,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2286},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgGdhUuSfbqyWFnmPqzX","type":"assistant","uuid":"fa132fc7-de9d-44ac-b069-6e5b610e03dd","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:15:05.011Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
{"parentUuid":"fa132fc7-de9d-44ac-b069-6e5b610e03dd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgGdoFg59zYKQpsxvQS4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014PUXpSQS4TgtcT3kMHqfj9","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/graphmark-bench/agentic-swebench\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport json,glob,os,re,sys\nsys.path.insert(0,'tools')\nPROJ=os.path.expanduser('~/.claude/projects')\nLOC=re.compile(r'\\b(grep|rg|find|ls|cat|sed -n)\\b')\ndef phase(tag,arm):\n    pre=[];post=[];ver=[];n=0\n    for d in glob.glob(f'results/{tag}/{arm}/*/'):\n        cc=f'{d}cc_out.json'\n        if not os.path.exists(cc): continue\n        try: s=json.load(open(cc)).get('session_id')\n        except Exception: continue\n        g=glob.glob(f'{PROJ}/*/{s}.jsonl')\n        if not g: continue\n        a=b=v=0; ed=False\n        for ln in open(g[0],errors='ignore'):\n            try: r=json.loads(ln)\n            except Exception: continue\n            if r.get('type')!='assistant': continue\n            for c in ((r.get('message') or {}).get('content') or []):\n                if not isinstance(c,dict) or c.get('type')!='tool_use': continue\n                nm=c.get('name',''); cmd=str((c.get('input') or {}).get('command',''))\n                if nm in ('Edit','Write','MultiEdit'): ed=True; continue\n                if nm=='Bash' and re.search(r'\\b(pytest|cargo|go test|npm|make|cmake|ctest|mvn|gradle|rspec|phpunit)\\b',cmd): v+=1; continue\n                if nm in ('Grep','Glob','Read') or (nm=='Bash' and LOC.search(cmd)):\n                    if ed: b+=1\n                    else: a+=1\n        pre.append(a); post.append(b); ver.append(v); n+=1\n    if not n: return None\n    return n,sum(pre)/n,sum(post)/n,sum(ver)/n\nCELLS=[('R30Obase','baseline','opus base FRUGAL'),('R30Oeg','eg','opus eg FRUGAL -14.0%'),\n       ('R30ObaseV3','baseline','opus base V3'),('R30OegV3','eg','opus eg V3 -5.5%'),\n       ('R30ObaseB','baseline','opus base BEST'),('R30OegBEST','eg','opus eg BEST -0.8%'),\n       ('HI_opus_baseline','baseline','opus base HI'),('HI_opus_eg','eg','opus eg HI +6.5%'),\n       ('OPREP2_baseline','baseline','opus base OPREP2'),('OPREP2_eg','eg','opus eg OPREP2 +0.6%'),\n       ('OFF_r1_baseline','baseline','opus base OFF(asym)'),('OFF_r1_eg','eg','opus eg OFF -46.5%'),\n       ('PUB_r1_baseline','baseline','opus base PUB'),('PUB_r1_eg','eg','opus eg PUB -11.2%')]\nprint(f\"{'cell':<28}{'n':>4}{'pre':>8}{'post':>8}{'build':>8}{'TOTAL':>8}\")\nfor tag,arm,lbl in CELLS:\n    r=phase(tag,arm)\n    if r: print(f'{lbl:<28}{r[0]:>4}{r[1]:>8.1f}{r[2]:>8.1f}{r[3]:>8.1f}{r[1]+r[2]+r[3]:>8.1f}')\nPY","description":"Post-edit floor across every historical Opus config"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2286,"cache_read_input_tokens":490845,"output_tokens":2813,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2286,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2813,"cache_read_input_tokens":490845,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2286,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2286},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgGdhUuSfbqyWFnmPqzX","type":"assistant","uuid":"57d6c7b3-ebb7-4ca8-b963-da607974f593","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:15:15.686Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
