{"parentUuid":"160e4e94-7e65-482f-a911-25250111493e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgGjCMckgCdRofVYQdyd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3396,"cache_read_input_tokens":493131,"output_tokens":3761,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3396,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":3761,"cache_read_input_tokens":493131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3396,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3396},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgGj94vgZQnuoLBYZnFA","type":"assistant","uuid":"0563300f-f39e-4588-a767-aa5f61487eb1","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:16:16.047Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
{"parentUuid":"0563300f-f39e-4588-a767-aa5f61487eb1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgGjCMckgCdRofVYQdyd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This is the most informative table of the session. Look at the totals:\n\n| cell | n | pre | post | build | **TOTAL ops** | tokens |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| eg FRUGAL | 30 | 3.6 | 0.7 | 0.7 | **5.0** (base 7.0) | **−14.0%** |\n| eg V3 | 30 | 4.6 | 0.8 | 1.0 | 6.3 (base 7.3) | −5.5% |\n| eg OPREP2 | 30 | 5.7 | 1.1 | 1.4 | 8.2 (base 8.3) | +0.6% |\n| **eg OFF** (asym) | 19 | **13.6** | 8.5 | 5.3 | **27.5** (base 39.0) | **−46.5%** |\n| **eg PUB** | 20 | **14.6** | 11.8 | 5.2 | **31.7** (base 35.7) | −11.2% |\n\nTwo things fall out that I had not seen:\n\n**1. Identical op reduction pays wildly differently by session length.** FRUGAL cut ops 7.0→5.0 (−29%) and got −14.0% tokens. OFF cut 39.0→27.5 (also −29%) and got **−46.5%**. Same proportional saving, 3× the token payoff — because in a long session each deleted turn carries far more context. Long sessions are where the leverage is, and PUB *is* a long session.\n\n**2. PUB's pre-edit locate is WORSE than its own baseline (14.6 vs 13.4), while OFF's was far better (13.6 vs 19.1).** That is the entire gap. PUB reduces ops only 11%; OFF reduced them 29%.\n\nBut OFF's baseline was the *stripped* one — it had no methodology, so it flailed at 19.1 pre-edit ops. So that −29% may be the methodology, not the tool. The config that settles it is G40 (both arms rich, official scaffold), which I ran but never phase-analysed:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3396,"cache_read_input_tokens":493131,"output_tokens":3761,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3396,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":3761,"cache_read_input_tokens":493131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3396,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3396},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgGj94vgZQnuoLBYZnFA","type":"assistant","uuid":"6b20abc5-d880-4c00-b965-ea3460da5c30","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:16:22.634Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
{"parentUuid":"6b20abc5-d880-4c00-b965-ea3460da5c30","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgGjCMckgCdRofVYQdyd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Nd3ycdnXDDBPUc9rTAx5g7","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/graphmark-bench/agentic-swebench\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport json,glob,os,re\nPROJ=os.path.expanduser('~/.claude/projects')\nLOC=re.compile(r'\\b(grep|rg|find|ls|cat|sed -n)\\b')\nVER=re.compile(r'\\b(pytest|cargo|go test|npm|make|cmake|ctest|mvn|gradle|rspec|phpunit)\\b')\ndef phase(tag,arm):\n    pre=post=ver=n=0\n    for d in glob.glob(f'results/{tag}/{arm}/*/'):\n        cc=f'{d}cc_out.json'\n        if not os.path.exists(cc): continue\n        try: s=json.load(open(cc)).get('session_id')\n        except Exception: continue\n        g=glob.glob(f'{PROJ}/*/{s}.jsonl')\n        if not g: continue\n        n+=1; ed=False\n        for ln in open(g[0],errors='ignore'):\n            try: r=json.loads(ln)\n            except Exception: continue\n            if r.get('type')!='assistant': continue\n            for c in ((r.get('message') or {}).get('content') or []):\n                if not isinstance(c,dict) or c.get('type')!='tool_use': continue\n                nm=c.get('name',''); cmd=str((c.get('input') or {}).get('command',''))\n                if nm in ('Edit','Write','MultiEdit'): ed=True; continue\n                if nm=='Bash' and VER.search(cmd): ver+=1; continue\n                if nm in ('Grep','Glob','Read') or (nm=='Bash' and LOC.search(cmd)):\n                    if ed: post+=1\n                    else: pre+=1\n    return (n,pre/n,post/n,ver/n) if n else None\nprint(f\"{'cell':<34}{'n':>4}{'pre':>7}{'post':>7}{'build':>7}{'TOTAL':>7}\")\nfor tag,arm,lbl in [('G40_r1_baseline','baseline','G40 base  rich+official'),\n                    ('G40_r1_eg','eg','G40 eg    rich+official +28.4%'),\n                    ('OFF_r1_baseline','baseline','OFF base  BARE+official'),\n                    ('OFF_r1_eg','eg','OFF eg    rich+official -46.5%'),\n                    ('PUB_r1_baseline','baseline','PUB base  none+published'),\n                    ('PUB_r1_eg','eg','PUB eg    capability -11.2%')]:\n    r=phase(tag,arm)\n    if r: print(f'{lbl:<34}{r[0]:>4}{r[1]:>7.1f}{r[2]:>7.1f}{r[3]:>7.1f}{r[1]+r[2]+r[3]:>7.1f}')\nprint()\nprint('ops ratio eg/base and token result:')\nfor b,e,lbl,tok in [('G40_r1_baseline','G40_r1_eg','G40 rich/rich official','+28.4%'),\n                    ('OFF_r1_baseline','OFF_r1_eg','OFF bare/rich official','-46.5%'),\n                    ('PUB_r1_baseline','PUB_r1_eg','PUB none/capability published','-11.2%')]:\n    rb=phase(b,'baseline'); re_=phase(e,'eg')\n    if rb and re_:\n        tb=rb[1]+rb[2]+rb[3]; te=re_[1]+re_[2]+re_[3]\n        print(f'  {lbl:<32} ops {tb:5.1f} -> {te:5.1f} = {te/tb-1:+6.1%}   tokens {tok}')\nPY","description":"Phase analysis of G40 to isolate methodology from tool"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3396,"cache_read_input_tokens":493131,"output_tokens":3761,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3396,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":3761,"cache_read_input_tokens":493131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3396,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3396},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgGj94vgZQnuoLBYZnFA","type":"assistant","uuid":"649e059d-e1ed-43ca-a11f-9f1d10fdae9a","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:16:33.761Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220