{"parentUuid":"832dec59-85df-4959-a325-8d176eedb532","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgGzyuD9c91afmsXFqDH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2659,"cache_read_input_tokens":506309,"output_tokens":2452,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2659,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2452,"cache_read_input_tokens":506309,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2659,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2659},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgGzuV4391QVxyTGZjbv","type":"assistant","uuid":"12c8dadc-a1b7-46cc-a58e-a190c48abe8c","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:19:49.060Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
{"parentUuid":"12c8dadc-a1b7-46cc-a58e-a190c48abe8c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgGzyuD9c91afmsXFqDH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The turn difference is dramatic:\n\n| config | arm | round trips | ktok/session |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| FRUGAL both-rich | baseline | **9.7** | 279k |\n| FRUGAL both-rich | eg | **8.2** | 246k |\n| PUBLISHED capability | baseline | **46.9** | **2,729k** |\n| PUBLISHED capability | eg | **40.0** | 2,418k |\n\nThe published prompt runs **4.8× more round trips and 10× more tokens per session** — yet the percentage saving is about the same (−14.0% frugal vs −11.2% published). Absolute saving differs enormously (33k vs 311k per session), but percentage is what we're scored on.\n\nAnd here's the thing the Haiku data just told me. On Haiku's best fair cells the tool **halves pre-edit locate**:\n\n| cell | pre-edit base → eg | ops Δ | tokens |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| haiku **S1** (n=50) | **16.2 → 8.5 (−48%)** | −39.3% | **−39.9%** |\n| haiku RR (n=21) | **14.2 → 6.3 (−56%)** | −46.7% | −44.7% |\n| haiku R30 (n=30) | 15.7 → 10.3 (−34%) | −32.8% | −42.9% |\n| **opus PUB** | **13.4 → 14.6 (+9%)** | −11.2% | −11.2% |\n\nOpus's baseline pre-edit (13.4) is *comparable* to Haiku's (16.2) — so this isn't \"Opus explores less\". It's that **no Opus config has ever halved pre-edit locate the way S1 does**, and S1 is the symmetric mirrored-block config with the best fair result in the entire program that **has never been run on Opus**.\n\nLet me confirm which flags reproduce it:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2659,"cache_read_input_tokens":506309,"output_tokens":2452,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2659,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2452,"cache_read_input_tokens":506309,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2659,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2659},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgGzuV4391QVxyTGZjbv","type":"assistant","uuid":"22997960-26f5-44a4-ac2b-28d8c4e1d8aa","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:19:55.687Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
{"parentUuid":"22997960-26f5-44a4-ac2b-28d8c4e1d8aa","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgGzyuD9c91afmsXFqDH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011UGJ2U7jMd6WDZbRvVSXdp","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/graphmark-bench/agentic-swebench\ne=$(ls results/S1eg_r1/eg/*/prompt.txt | head -1)\necho \"=== S1 eg block, first lines (normalised) ===\"\npython3 -c \"\nimport re\ns=open('$e',errors='ignore').read(); s=re.sub(r'/private\\S+|/Users/\\S+','<GQ>',s)\ni=s.find('A precomputed'); print(s[i:i+520])\"\necho\necho \"=== which function emits this? ===\"\ngrep -n \"Use it to LOCATE the fix BEFORE any\" tools/run_3arm.sh\necho \"=== flags for those functions ===\"\ngrep -n \"EG_GATED_CLAMP\\|EG_SHIPPED_PROMPT\\|BASE_CLAMP\" tools/run_3arm.sh | grep -v \"^#\" | head -8","description":"Identify the exact flags that reproduce S1"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2659,"cache_read_input_tokens":506309,"output_tokens":2452,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2659,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2452,"cache_read_input_tokens":506309,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2659,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2659},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgGzuV4391QVxyTGZjbv","type":"assistant","uuid":"cc7a9cef-081d-4f28-aea5-72578080d6c2","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:19:59.621Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-co