t, and STOP. The search top hit is the fix site on most tasks - go\n +straight there and edit; do NOT re-search or grep to 'confirm'. Reach the edit in as FEW turns as\n +possible (every turn re-reads your whole context - that is the token cost).\n +Hard rules: (N) LOCATE WITH THE TOOL FIRST. (N) After the tool answers, READ the file directly\n +(line range) and EDIT - do not chain more tool calls. (N) NEVER read a whole file to explore; pass\n +a line range. (N) NEVER search outside this repo. Apply the minimal fix and STOP the moment you can\n +justify it.\n +If TWO searches have not put you on the right code, fall back to the shell (grep/find) in ONE\n +batched call rather than staying stuck.\n +Other verbs if the result genuinely leaves a question: <P> def <Symbol> (full source of a symbol),\n +<P> callers <Symbol> (inbound call paths, file:line and hop), <P> impact <Symbol> (callers, callees,\n +type consumers, co-change files and siblings in one shot), <P> grep <regex> (grep mapped onto the\n +enclosing symbol and ranked by hit density).\n\nclause                  base  eg\nFIRST action               1   1\nREAD line range            3   3\ndo NOT re-confirm          1   1\nas FEW turns               0   1\n4 hard rules               1   1\nNEVER whole file           1   1\nNEVER outside repo         1   1\nSTOP when justified        1   1\nTWO-then-fallback          1   1\n\nwords: baseline 389  eg 435\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"185aeedc-47e2-4345-90d0-e41c8936e90f","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:25:08.867Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"7:# S1 = PROMPT_FAMILY=vendor BASE_CLAMP=1 EG_SHIPPED_PROMPT=1 EG_SHIPPED_PROMPT_ACK=1.\n15:export PROMPT_FAMILY=vendor BASE_CLAMP=1 EG_SHIPPED_PROMPT=1 EG_SHIPPED_PROMPT_ACK=1\n=== baseline 57 lines / eg 62 lines ===\n --- baseline\n +++ eg\n @@ -46,12 +46,17 @@\n -Locate the fix with the shell BEFORE reading anything. Your FIRST action is ONE batched search:\n -put every probe you alr