{"parentUuid":"8feb4aa6-3cea-4d09-ab76-e81bc80b0ca7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgHV2tpzHwo7HmMHhvrB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01X3MtwqZN6Rx6cpntTJNxvU","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/graphmark-bench/agentic-swebench\nrm -rf results/S1PROBE results/S1O_r1_baseline results/S1O_r1_eg\npython3 -c \"\nimport json\ninst=[x['instance_id'] for x in json.load(open('tasks/opus20_official.json'))['instances']]\nwith open('/tmp/mcptest/s1jobs.txt','w') as f:\n    for i in inst:\n        for a in ('baseline','eg'): f.write(f'1|{a}|{i}\\n')\nls=open('/tmp/mcptest/s1jobs.txt').read().splitlines()\nprint('jobs',len(ls),'malformed',sum(1 for l in ls if l.count('|')!=2))\"\n: > /tmp/mcptest/s1.log\nnohup bash /tmp/mcptest/launch.sh /tmp/mcptest/s1worker.sh /tmp/mcptest/s1jobs.txt 10 /tmp/mcptest/s1.log >/dev/null 2>&1 &\nsleep 100\necho \"load=$(pgrep -f 'claude -p'|wc -l|tr -d ' ')  BADJOB=$(grep -c BADJOB /tmp/mcptest/s1.log)\"\necho \"S1O: base=$(ls results/S1O_r1_baseline/baseline 2>/dev/null|wc -l|tr -d ' ')/20 eg=$(ls results/S1O_r1_eg/eg 2>/dev/null|wc -l|tr -d ' ')/20\"\necho \"=== live prompts: clause parity + no shared block ===\"\nfor a in baseline eg; do f=$(ls results/S1O_r1_${a}/${a}/*/prompt.txt 2>/dev/null|head -1)\n  [ -n \"$f\" ] && printf \"  %-9s words=%-4s hardrules=%s STOP=%s ifTWO=%s official100=%s\\n\" \"$a\" \"$(wc -w <$f|tr -d ' ')\" \\\n   \"$(grep -c 'Hard rules' $f)\" \"$(grep -c 'STOP the moment' $f)\" \"$(grep -c 'If TWO' $f)\" \"$(grep -c 'more than 100 times' $f)\"; done\necho \"=== cache isolation live? ===\"\nls -d /tmp/mcptest/iso/* 2>/dev/null | head -3 | sed 's/^/  /'","description":"Launch the S1-on-Opus cell"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3597,"cache_read_input_tokens":535369,"output_tokens":986,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3597,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":986,"cache_read_input_tokens":535369,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3597,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3597},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgHUv5JjYbixxUnDduPS","type":"assistant","uuid":"4d79d431-447a-4f81-aaa8-f211acffe993","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:26:01.090Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
{"parentUuid":"4d79d431-447a-4f81-aaa8-f211acffe993","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"0813e2c2-9e63-40ae-82ae-61cde2f8fc2a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01X3MtwqZN6Rx6cpntTJNxvU","type":"tool_result","content":"jobs 40 malformed 0\nload=9  BADJOB=0\nS1O: base=8/20 eg=7/20\n=== live prompts: clause parity + no shared block ===\n  baseline  words=356  hardrules=1 STOP=1 ifTWO=1 official100=0\n  eg        words=402  hardrules=1 STOP=1 ifTWO=1 official100=0\n=== cache isolation live? ===\n  /tmp/mcptest/iso/1_baseline_apache__lucene-13170\n  /tmp/mcptest/iso/1_baseline_astral-sh__ruff-15626\n  /tmp/mcptest/iso/1_baseline_briannesbitt__carbon-2752\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d6a54fa5-a561-4acd-b8c4-0ca85634f078","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:27:41.786Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"jobs 40 malformed 0\nload=9  BADJOB=0\nS1O: base=8/20 eg=7/20\n=== live prompts: clause parity + no shared block ===\n  baseline  words=356  hardrules=1 STOP=1 ifTWO=1 official100=0\n  eg        words=402  hardrules=1 STOP=1 ifTWO=1 official100=0\n=== cache isolation live? ===\n  /tmp/mcptest/iso/1_baseline_apache__lucene-13170\n  /tmp/mcptest/iso/1_baseline_astral-sh__ruff-15626\n  /tmp/mcptest/iso/1_baseline_briannesbitt__carbon-2752","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4d79d431-447a-4f81-aaa8-f211acffe993","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
{"parentUuid":"d6a54fa5-a561-4acd-b8c4-0ca85634f078","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgHdUsk24zSRdgVCnvyd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"S1-on-Opus is running — 40 sessions, load 9, zero bad jobs, clause parity confirmed on the live prompts (356 vs 402 words, the delta being the verb list), and per-instance cache isolation active.\n\n**What this cell is and why it's the right one:**\n\nThe forensic sweep settled that the tool is equally broken in winners and losers — 27 of 28 payload-defect hypotheses died on winner-control, including every one I had written into a plan. So there's nothing to fix in the payload. What the old data *did* show is that tokens are a near-pure function of the op-count ratio, and eg's op count is invariant (27.5 / 28.7 / 31.7 across three very different prompts) while the **baseline's** swings 23.8 → 39.0 purely on how much methodology its prompt carries.\n\nThat reframes both withdrawn headlines: −46.5% was a crippled control at 39.0 ops, +28.4% was a control given *better* discipline than eg at 23.8. Neither measured the tool.\n\nThe one thing no Opus config has ever done is halve pre-edit locate — which is the tool's actual job. S1 does exactly that on Haiku (16.2 → 8.5, −48%, n=50, −39.9% tokens) and it has never been run on Opus, where pre-edit currently goes the *wrong* way (13.4 → 14.6). Opus's baseline pre-edit is comparable to Haiku's, so this isn't \"Opus explores less.\"\n\nTwo things I'm watching:\n\n- **Leading indicator:** pre-edit locate must go negative. Every cell that reached ≤ −25% had it at −34% or better. If it hasn't turned by ~8 pairs, I'll stop the cell rather than pay for all 40 — the tokens cannot follow without it.\n- **The integrity fix changes a known number.** Isolating the caches removes caddy's baseline leak, so caddy's −56% should degrade to roughly −25/−41%. That's correct, not a regression — it was a contaminated number. Carbon's eg arm loses its leak too, direction unknown.\n\nHonest expectation stays −20% to −35%, wide, with a real chance it lands near −11% and settles the question negatively."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1250,"cache_read_input_tokens":538966,"output_tokens":731,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1250,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":731,"cache_read_input_tokens":538966,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1250,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1250},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgHdPUYp5txKrTfGvBMo","type":"assistant","uuid":"39801d6f-13e5-4bc7-85ac-6b5ad98f507e","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:27:56.720Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
