{"parentUuid":"af4b53b5-cdbd-4e23-943e-8969a07704fa","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgHgpjRPzHJkzdZz4Lni","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Update — 8 of 40 done, load 9, zero bad jobs, zero censored. And the result is already legible, though not in a good way.**\n\n| arm | n | pre | post | build | **TOTAL ops** |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| baseline | 5 | 3.0 | 0.0 | 0.0 | **3.0** |\n| eg | 4 | 2.8 | 0.0 | 0.0 | **2.8** |\n\nLeading indicator: pre-edit **−8.3%** — technically negative for the first time on Opus. Tokens +6.8% at n=4, CI [−19.4, +49.7], winners 2/4.\n\nBut look at the absolute numbers. S1's clamp compresses Opus from PUB's **35.7 ops to 3.0** — a 12× compression — with post-edit and build at **zero**. The agent searches ~3 times, edits, and stops. There is essentially nothing left for the tool to remove: the headroom is 0.2 ops.\n\nThis is the FRUGAL regime again. Compare:\n\n| config | baseline ops | eg ops | tokens |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| FRUGAL | 7.0 | 5.0 | −14.0% |\n| **S1 on Opus** | **3.0** | **2.8** | +6.8% (n=4) |\n| PUB | 35.7 | 31.7 | −11.2% |\n\nAnd it explains why S1 worked on Haiku: Haiku's S1 baseline ran **24.6** ops — it doesn't obey the clamp tightly, so there was waste to remove. Opus obeys it almost perfectly, which eliminates the very waste the tool exists to eliminate.\n\nThat's the vise, and it's now measured from both sides: **any prompt that makes the Opus baseline efficient removes the tool's headroom; any prompt that lets it flail is the asymmetry we already rejected.** OFF's −46.5% sat at one end (baseline 39.0 ops, crippled), S1 sits at the other (baseline 3.0 ops, maximally disciplined), and the honest middle is PUB's −11.2%.\n\nI'll let it reach a scoreable n before calling it — n=4 is nothing, and I've been wrong at low n repeatedly today. But I don't expect this to clear −25%, and if it doesn't, the pre-registered conclusion stands: −25% on Opus is not reachable with any config in this program."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1716,"cache_read_input_tokens":540950,"output_tokens":1709,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1716,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1709,"cache_read_input_tokens":540950,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1716,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1716},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgHgZoz6x7mXCRYnDHJX","type":"assistant","uuid":"89cdc5f4-8dba-4fb7-b304-98e6fac021b7","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:28:54.461Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
