{"parentUuid":"3701f8fb-ac65-4a7f-a06f-d25f443e5902","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgJ3zxQrkET9j7nyZmra","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1812,"cache_read_input_tokens":544378,"output_tokens":2156,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1812,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2156,"cache_read_input_tokens":544378,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1812,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1812},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgJ3t7uDTfUCFRW1St8c","type":"assistant","uuid":"d24de7bb-ec6f-4051-b24d-a2026ba9f0d4","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:33:36.014Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
{"parentUuid":"d24de7bb-ec6f-4051-b24d-a2026ba9f0d4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgJ3zxQrkET9j7nyZmra","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Update — 30 of 40 done, n=15. The mechanism worked and the tokens still went the wrong way.**\n\n| arm | n | pre | post | build | TOTAL ops | graph calls/session |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| baseline | 17 | 3.9 | 0.4 | 0.6 | 4.9 | 0.00 |\n| eg | 15 | **2.8** | 0.3 | 0.7 | **3.8** | **1.07** |\n\n- **pre-edit locate −27.9%** — the leading indicator fired. First time on Opus.\n- **total ops −22.2%.**\n- The agent actually uses the tool (1.07 calls/session vs 0.20 in PUB).\n- **tokens +10.9%**, CI [−6.0, +31.6], winners 7/15. 171k → 192k per session.\n\nSo I got exactly the mechanism I set out to get — the locate phase genuinely collapsed — and it produced a token *loss*. That's decisive, and it closes the vise from the second side:\n\n| regime | baseline ops | ops Δ | tokens |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| long sessions (PUB, published prompt) | 35.7 | −11.2% | **−11.2%** |\n| **short sessions (S1 clamp)** | **4.9** | **−22.2%** | **+10.9%** |\n\nThe \"tokens track ops\" law I found earlier only holds in long sessions. At 4.9 ops the session is 171k tokens and eg's ~7 KB payload, re-read every message, costs about 10% — more than the 1.1 saved ops return. Long sessions amortise the payload but only yield −11% ops; short sessions yield −22% ops but can't pay for the payload.\n\n**My honest read: −25% on Opus is not reachable on this sample by any configuration in this program.** The evidence is now four-cornered — asymmetric-favourable (−46.5%, invalid), both-rich-official (+28.4%), published-capability (−11.2%), and locate-clamped (+10.9%) — with the mechanism achieved and refuted in the last one. The defensible Opus numbers are **−11.2%** (published prompt) and **−14.0%** (frugal both-rich, n=23).\n\nI'll let the remaining 10 jobs land so the cell is complete and on the record rather than a partial. If you want me to keep pushing, the only untried direction I can see with any basis is shrinking the payload itself to cut the ~10% tax in short sessions — but the arithmetic says that buys single digits, not 14 points, so I'd be spending your money to confirm a ceiling I can already derive."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1812,"cache_read_input_tokens":544378,"output_tokens":2156,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1812,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2156,"cache_read_input_tokens":544378,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1812,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1812},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgJ3t7uDTfUCFRW1St8c","type":"assistant","uuid":"b7dfdc18-8f50-4fd3-a354-a1cf03674a2b","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:33:46.967Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
