{"parentUuid":"76604426-16a3-4578-89c8-9df5588197d2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgJVsywY6XSYun9nFczt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Running. Clean single-variable diff off the S1 worker, live prompts confirmed carrying both the clamp and the scaffold in both arms, cache isolation active, zero bad jobs.\n\n**Why this is the config with a real shot, stated as a falsifiable claim rather than hope:**\n\nEvery previous Opus cell failed for one of two reasons, and they're opposites. Long sessions amortise eg's payload (2.9% tax) but the tool only cut 11% of ops. Short sessions cut 22% of ops but the payload tax hits 10% and swamps it. This pairs the clamp that produced the −22% op cut with the scaffold that produces the long sessions.\n\nPre-registered so it can't be rationalised after the fact:\n\n- **Leading indicator:** pre-edit locate must land near S1's −28%, not the published prompt's +9%. Checkable from ops before scoring tokens.\n- **Session length must stay long** — baseline ops materially above S1's 4.9. If the clamp compresses sessions to ~5 ops again, the payload tax returns and the cell fails for the known reason.\n- **Success = geomean ≤ −25% with the CI upper bound below zero.**\n- **Failure condition:** if ops fall ~25% and tokens still don't reach −25%, then the payload tax is not amortising as the PUB cell implies, and I'll have measured the ceiling from a third independent direction.\n\nTwo caveats I'm holding honestly. The projection assumes S1's −28% pre-edit rate transfers to a longer session, which is an extrapolation across regimes — the thing that has burned every prediction I made today. And the scaffold's reproduce-and-verify work is ops the graph cannot touch, which dilutes the ratio; that's already in the 26.6 projection, but if build ops grow beyond PUB's 6.8 the arithmetic degrades.\n\nS1O still has ~10 jobs finishing alongside; I'll report both cells."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1311,"cache_read_input_tokens":553857,"output_tokens":645,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1311,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":645,"cache_read_input_tokens":553857,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1311,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1311},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgJVoN8PcdjGXPrTByB3","type":"assistant","uuid":"26afc013-e51c-4290-b020-e5367b186c8c","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:39:21.074Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
