{"parentUuid":"1af884de-207c-4671-9f57-06d954f08179","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgKL38hGVXrRM75CcDRa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both live cells are failing their pre-registered gates:\n\n| cell | baseline ops (need ≥20) | eg pre-edit (need ≤−25%) | ops Δ | tokens |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| CB | **10.5** ✗ | −22.2% | −20.6% | +7.5% (n=3) |\n| GC | **11.5** ✗ | **+40.0%** ✗ | +4.3% | +22.2% (n=1) |\n\nThe gated clamp does not reduce pre-edit — it *raises* it. And neither config restored long sessions. But fitting all six configs together shows exactly where the goal lives, and it's not where I've been looking."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2040,"cache_read_input_tokens":596890,"output_tokens":3862,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2040,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3862,"cache_read_input_tokens":596890,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2040,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2040},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgKKu4WpTt6x2UwHzUBi","type":"assistant","uuid":"ffc87459-4ef7-4911-aaa8-30c5c014f7df","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:50:39.861Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
{"parentUuid":"ffc87459-4ef7-4911-aaa8-30c5c014f7df","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgKL38hGVXrRM75CcDRa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Sv9RsMwcdFS1e2nSHi1nrX","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/graphmark-bench/agentic-swebench\npython3 - <<'PY'\nrows=[('PUB',35.7,-11.2,2729,-11.2),('G40',23.8,+21.1,1300,+28.4),('FRUGAL',7.0,-28.6,279,-14.0),\n      ('S1O',4.6,-8.0,175,+18.2),('CB',10.5,-20.6,345,+7.5),('GC',11.5,+4.3,378,+22.2)]\nprint(f\"{'config':<9}{'base ops':>9}{'ops%':>8}{'ktok':>7}{'tokens%':>9}{'PENALTY':>9}\")\nfor n,bo,op,kt,tk in sorted(rows,key=lambda r:-r[3]):\n    print(f'{n:<9}{bo:>9.1f}{op:>+8.1f}{kt:>7}{tk:>+9.1f}{tk-op:>+9.1f}')\nprint('\\nPENALTY = tokens% - ops% = the payload tax, and it is a pure function of session size:')\nprint('  2729k -> 0.0    1300k -> +7.3    378k -> +17.9    345k -> +28.1    279k -> +14.6    175k -> +26.2')\nprint('\\nTo hit -25% tokens you need ops% + penalty <= -25%:')\nfor kt,pen in ((2729,0),(1300,7.3),(345,28.1),(175,26.2)):\n    print(f'  at {kt}k (penalty {pen:+.1f}): need ops <= {-25-pen:+.1f}%')\nprint('\\nONLY the longest regime is viable. PUB is there (penalty 0) but cuts just -11.2% of ops.')\nprint('\\nPUB ops budget:  base pre 13.4 post 15.5 build 6.8 = 35.7')\nprint('                 eg   pre 14.6 post 11.8 build 5.2 = 31.7  (-11.2%)')\nneed=35.7*0.75\nprint(f'  target for -25% ops: eg total <= {need:.1f}')\nprint(f'  if eg pre-edit merely MATCHED baseline (13.4): total {13.4+11.8+5.2:.1f} = {(13.4+11.8+5.2)/35.7-1:+.1%}')\nprint(f'  ...and post-edit re-hunts removed (11.8 -> 7.1): total {14.6+7.1+5.2:.1f} = {(14.6+7.1+5.2)/35.7-1:+.1%}  <-- GOAL')\nprint('\\n  measured: \"re-finds text the payload already printed\" = 5.58/session (winners), 7.25 (losers)')\nprint('            payload bodies carrying line numbers = 0 of 55, 0 of 107, 0 of 79  (20/20 instances)')\nprint('            the eg prompt promises \"at its real line numbers\"')\nPY","description":"Fit the token model across all six configs"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2040,"cache_read_input_tokens":596890,"output_tokens":3862,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2040,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3862,"cache_read_input_tokens":596890,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2040,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2040},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgKKu4WpTt6x2UwHzUBi","type":"assistant","uuid":"0e1c6978-faf2-44d0-b6c8-7b32c6b028cd","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:50:51.122Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
{"parentUuid":"0e1c6978-faf2-44d0-b6c8-7b32c6b028cd","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4cfad49e-246c-49ef-b5bd-807cc83b7bba","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Sv9RsMwcdFS1e2nSHi1nrX","type":"tool_result","content":"config    base ops    ops%   ktok  tokens%  PENALTY\nPUB           35.7   -11.2   2729    -11.2     +0.0\nG40           23.8   +21.1   1300    +28.4     +7.3\nGC            11.5    +4.3    378    +22.2    +17.9\nCB            10.5   -20.6    345     +7.5    +28.1\nFRUGAL         7.0   -28.6    279    -14.0    +14.6\nS1O            4.6    -8.0    175    +18.2    +26.2\n\nPENALTY = tokens% - ops% = the payload tax, and it is a pure function of session size:\n  2729k -> 0.0    1300k -> +7.3    378k -> +17.9    345k -> +28.1    279k -> +14.6    175k -> +26.2\n\nTo hit -25% tokens you need ops% + penalty <= -25%:\n  at 2729k (penalty +0.0): need ops <= -25.0%\n  at 1300k (penalty +7.3): need ops <= -32.3%\n  at 345k (penalty +28.1): need ops <= -53.1%\n  at 175k (penalty +26.2): need ops <= -51.2%\n\nONLY the longest regime is viable. PUB is there (penalty 0) but cuts just -11.2% of ops.\n\nPUB ops budget:  base pre 13.4 post 15.5 build 6.8 = 35.7\n                 eg   pre 14.6 post 11.8 build 5.2 = 31.7  (-11.2%)\n  target for -25% ops: eg total <= 26.8\n  if eg pre-edit merely MATCHED baseline (13.4): total 30.4 = -14.8%\n  ...and post-edit re-hunts removed (11.8 -> 7.1): total 26.9 = -24.6%  <-- GOAL\n\n  measured: \"re-finds text the payload already printed\" = 5.58/session (winners), 7.25 (losers)\n            payload bodies carrying line numbers = 0 of 55, 0 of 107, 0 of 79  (20/20 instances)\n            the eg prompt promises \"at its real line numbers\"\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"23238ecc-8b6a-40c4-975b-6e1fd9f96e81","timestamp":"2026-08-03T18:50:51.461Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"config    base ops    ops%   ktok  tokens%  PENALTY\nPUB           35.7   -11.2   2729    -11.2     +0.0\nG40           23.8   +21.1   1300    +28.4     +7.3\nGC            11.5    +4.3    378    +22.2    +17.9\nCB            10.5   -20.6    345     +7.5    +28.1\nFRUGAL         7.0   -28.6    279    -14.0    +14.6\nS1O            4.6    -8.0    175    +18.2    +26.2\n\nPENALTY = tokens% - ops% = the payload tax, and it is a pure function of session size:\n  2729k -> 0.0    1300k -> +7.3    378k -> +17.9    345k -> +28.1    279k -> +14.6    175k -> +26.2\n\nTo hit -25% tokens you need ops% + penalty <= -25%:\n  at 2729k (penalty +0.0): need ops <= -25.0%\n  at 1300k (penalty +7.3): need ops <= -32.3%\n  at 345k (penalty +28.1): need ops <= -53.1%\n  at 175k (penalty +26.2): need ops <= -51.2%\n\nONLY the longest regime is viable. PUB is there (penalty 0) but cuts just -11.2% of ops.\n\nPUB ops budget:  base pre 13.4 post 15.5 build 6.8 = 35.7\n                 eg   pre 14.6 post 11.8 build 5.2 = 31.7  (-11.2%)\n  target for -25% ops: eg total <= 26.8\n  if eg pre-edit merely MATCHED baseline (13.4): total 30.4 = -14.8%\n  ...and post-edit re-hunts removed (11.8 -> 7.1): total 26.9 = -24.6%  <-- GOAL\n\n  measured: \"re-finds text the payload already printed\" = 5.58/session (winners), 7.25 (losers)\n            payload bodies carrying line numbers = 0 of 55, 0 of 107, 0 of 79  (20/20 instances)\n            the eg prompt promises \"at its real line numbers\"","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0e1c6978-faf2-44d0-b6c8-7b32c6b028cd","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
