{"parentUuid":"1de31207-48f7-4b8d-8258-eb105810a25e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgLWPREQBnh8H3v7W72i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Found it. Your tip was right, and this is the strongest lead of the session.**\n\nLocate ops per session in PUB, split by whether the target is a **test** artifact:\n\n| | pre-edit TEST | pre-edit other | post-edit TEST | post-edit other | TOTAL |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| baseline | 5.2 | 8.5 | 7.4 | 11.8 | 32.9 |\n| eg | **5.6** | 9.6 | 5.7 | 7.9 | 28.8 |\n| delta | **+0.4** | +1.1 | −1.7 | −3.9 | −4.1 |\n\n**Test-hunting is 39% of all eg locate ops — 11.3 per session — and eg does *more* pre-edit test-hunting than the no-tool baseline.**\n\nAnd here's the defect: **the payload carries a `COVERING TEST` block in only 5 of 20 instances.** So the single largest slice of the locate phase is one the graph mostly declines to answer, and the agent goes to the shell for it — `grep -n \"trailing\" brokenLinks.test.ts`, `cat TestOpenNLPSentenceBreakIterator.java`, `grep -n \"BITCOUNT\" tests/unit/bitops.tcl`, `ls tests/…/LookupRef/`.\n\nThe arithmetic, and it clears the goal:\n\n| | eg ops | vs baseline 32.9 |\n|---|---|---|\n| now | 28.8 | −12.3% |\n| **if the payload answered test-location** | **23.2** | **−29.4%** |\n\nAt PUB's session size the payload tax is measured at **0.0**, so −29.4% ops ⇒ **≈ −29% tokens**. That's the first projection this session that isn't extrapolating across regimes — it's the same cell, same session length, same tax.\n\nWhy it's absent in 15/20: `search_verify.go` resolves the covering test only from an *indexed* test that references the symbol (`subject.testPath`). redis's tests are `.tcl` (not indexed at all), and the `src/Foo.php → tests/FooTest.php` heuristic misses repo conventions like `__tests__/`, `spec/`, `snapshots/`, `resources/test/fixtures/`, `tests/unit/*.tcl`.\n\nThat's a locate function the tool should own, it's tool-side, it needs no prompt change, and it's correctly sized. I'll fix covering-test resolution across those conventions, verify offline on all 20 that the block now emits and points at a real test, then re-run the PUB cell — everything else identical, so it's a clean single-variable comparison against −11.2%."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3615,"cache_read_input_tokens":641142,"output_tokens":1840,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3615,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1840,"cache_read_input_tokens":641142,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3615,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3615},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgLWFP3Nd7GF97Rgiyp4","type":"assistant","uuid":"10d2fcf2-4599-4141-9941-847c264f4918","timestamp":"2026-08-03T19:05:53.745Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
