{"parentUuid":"0fd49651-481b-41eb-9313-9ef9bbe32e41","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgLYvTq7HWwTQHCQwZwf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I can see exactly why it misses. The mirror probes a fixed affix/dir table:\n\n- affixes: `_test`, `.test`, `Test`, `_spec`, `.spec`, `Spec`, `-test` — all **suffixes**\n- dir swaps: `src/main/java/→src/test/java/`, `src/→tests/`, `src/→test/`, `src/→spec/`, `lib/→test/`, `lib/→spec/`\n\nAgainst my 20 instances that misses: Lucene's **prefix** convention (`TestOpenNLPSentenceBreakIterator.java`) and its `src/java/→src/test/` swap; phpspreadsheet's `src/PhpSpreadsheet/→tests/PhpSpreadsheetTests/` (second segment changes too); redis/valkey's `src/t_list.c→tests/unit/type/list.tcl`; ruff's fixture/snapshot layout. Let me confirm against the real checkouts before coding:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1365,"cache_read_input_tokens":646599,"output_tokens":2046,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1365,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2046,"cache_read_input_tokens":646599,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1365,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1365},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgLYpQx2X1WgUv7nYPui","type":"assistant","uuid":"17d3648d-074c-4b9f-8f91-5387561b9205","timestamp":"2026-08-03T19:06:22.630Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
