{"parentUuid":"d40c15f1-3df5-4c2d-be0d-3905ed181c87","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d432411c-b0af-4900-a7cd-ff3a4a846c33","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EQwx3dshyJdmk6KP85uQL2","type":"tool_result","content":"load=7  BADJOB=0\nR30PUB: base=4/30 eg=4/30\n  LIVE baseline  words=295   uploaded_files=2 coaching=0\n  LIVE eg        words=975   uploaded_files=2 coaching=0\n  prefetch=5622B binary=eg-f19\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"b2e44cf4-8ba2-4d92-af44-4634da20eb14","timestamp":"2026-08-03T19:15:24.330Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"load=7  BADJOB=0\nR30PUB: base=4/30 eg=4/30\n  LIVE baseline  words=295   uploaded_files=2 coaching=0\n  LIVE eg        words=975   uploaded_files=2 coaching=0\n  prefetch=5622B binary=eg-f19","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d40c15f1-3df5-4c2d-be0d-3905ed181c87","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
{"parentUuid":"b2e44cf4-8ba2-4d92-af44-4634da20eb14","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgMGVbXiZQ6mgQGFyhXz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Update — rep30 on the PUB config is running: 60 sessions, load 7, zero bad jobs, prompts verified coaching-free in both arms, `eg-f19`.**\n\nTwo things happened since the last update.\n\n**1. I reverted my own fix, because it was inert.** The covering-test mirror extension resolved 10 of 12 in a unit test but produced **byte-identical payloads** on the real checkouts — 1644, 2110, 3876 bytes, unchanged. The reason is that I improved the wrong code path: the `COVERING TEST` *block* comes from ranked results, while the mirror only feeds the `VERIFY` command. My harness had made the true test the only existing file, which is exactly the false-positive risk I flagged one message earlier, and the real-checkout check caught it. `eg-consolidated` is back to clean at `024f25a`.\n\n**2. Launched rep30 as you asked.** Identical to the −11.2% config except the task file — so it isolates the instance set, which is the right shape for your point about the 20 holding the losers.\n\nThere's real prior evidence behind that instinct. On six historical Opus cells I measured the 20-instance subset at **+3.9% mean** against the excluded instances at **−13.7%** — a ~17-point gap — and the mechanism was visible in the denominators: the excluded instances' baselines burn **1.6–2.2× more tokens**, which is the high-exploration regime where a locate tool pays. So rep30 should come in better than −11.2%, though how much is exactly what this measures.\n\nTwo caveats I'd rather state now. This cell carries the **same leak exposure** as PUB — I deliberately left the cache isolation out so the comparison stays single-variable, and rep30 contains caddy, carbon-3098 and fmt-2457, so known channels are open in both cells. And 60 sessions at PUB's ~2.7M tokens each is the most expensive cell of the session by a wide margin.\n\nI'll report ops alongside tokens as usual — at PUB length ops predicted tokens to within 0.0 points, so it's the early read."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1465,"cache_read_input_tokens":681340,"output_tokens":689,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1465,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":689,"cache_read_input_tokens":681340,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1465,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1465},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgMGLhVshFMYfS8o8DY8","type":"assistant","uuid":"3b76bab9-8221-4d69-837e-bf5da121402f","timestamp":"2026-08-03T19:15:39.670Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
