{"parentUuid":"7c691b27-0234-4db8-982c-619004ecc8f4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgMLcRuGv7trLREBcuty","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Update — 0 of 60 finished, load 8, zero bad jobs.**\n\nNo completions yet, which is expected: PUB sessions run ~47 round trips and 2.7M tokens each, so first landings are 15–25 minutes in and the first wave started about that long ago. Nothing scoreable, no ops table yet.\n\nFor reference when it does land, the comparison target is the 20-instance official cell: **−11.2%**, baseline 2,729k/session, ops 35.7 → 31.7.\n\nThe prediction this cell tests, stated so it can be checked rather than narrated: rep30 should come in **better than −11.2%**, because on six historical Opus cells the 20-instance subset averaged **+3.9%** while the excluded instances averaged **−13.7%**, and the mechanism was in the denominators — the excluded instances' baselines burn 1.6–2.2× more tokens. If rep30 lands near −11% anyway, that subset effect doesn't transfer to the published prompt and your instinct about the 20 being the hostile set would be specific to the older cells.\n\n60 jobs at 8 parallel means roughly 2–3 hours to complete. I'll report ops as soon as ~8 pairs land, since at this session length ops predicted tokens to within 0.0 points and gives the early read well before the geomean stabilises."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1825,"cache_read_input_tokens":683497,"output_tokens":437,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1825,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":437,"cache_read_input_tokens":683497,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1825,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tok