{"parentUuid":"982caf68-c841-4ffe-a752-46d40785b392","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgN3Q6PhFbriLEaFKSoL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2471,"cache_read_input_tokens":711495,"output_tokens":1707,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2471,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1707,"cache_read_input_tokens":711495,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2471,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2471},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgN3JCgLcDniGLFeF53e","type":"assistant","uuid":"d1b5b3fe-1940-4de9-b729-06e62ffcb402","timestamp":"2026-08-03T19:25:53.594Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
{"parentUuid":"d1b5b3fe-1940-4de9-b729-06e62ffcb402","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgN3Q6PhFbriLEaFKSoL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Update — rep30 at 0/60 finished (load 8, zero bad jobs), and the stage-3 probe came back mostly negative.**\n\n| instance | test payload | gold test found? |\n|---|---|---|\n| hugo-12204 | 5477B | **FOUND** |\n| fmt-2457 | 2021B | not found |\n| ruff-15626 | 2225B | not found |\n| lucene-13170 | **0B** (empty) | not found |\n\n**1 of 4.** Not enough to justify a 40-session cell, and there's a specific reason worth recording: my own fix broke the one case that worked.\n\nThe manual test that succeeded earlier used the query `\"test for join\"` — and `join` came from the **issue text** (\"fmt::join tuple does not support format specifiers\"), not from the payload. When I wired it up I keyed the query on the top hit's **file stem** (`ranges`) to dodge the truncated-symbol bug, and `\"test for ranges\"` does *not* find `ranges-test.cc`. So the truncation workaround cost me the hit. And in the very first probe, the cap-exhausted **literal fallback** on `ranges_tes` accidentally found it — so the only two fmt successes came from paths I then engineered away.\n\nThat points at the actual answer: the query that locates a test is the issue's own distinctive identifier plus \"test\", not anything derived from the payload. That's a one-line change to what stage 3 asks, and it's testable offline for free before spending anything.\n\nlucene returning **0 bytes** is a separate defect — the search produced nothing at all for `\"test for OpenNLPSentenceBreakIterator\"`, on an instance where the gold test is a *sibling file with the same stem plus a `Test` prefix*. That one should be trivially findable, so something is wrong in either the query or the test-file indexing there.\n\nWhere things stand: rep30 is the live cell answering your instance-set question, and I won't run the test-prefetch cell until the offline hit rate is materially better than 1/4 — spending 40 Opus sessions on a stage that finds the test a quarter of the time would burn money to measure noise. The comparison agent is still running."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2471,"cache_read_input_tokens":711495,"output_tokens":1707,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2471,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1707,"cache_read_input_tokens":711495,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2471,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2471},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgN3JCgLcDniGLFeF53e","type":"assistant","uuid":"9243e91f-5bbe-497f-ac7b-245511cf87c9","timestamp":"2026-08-03T19:26:03.328Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
