{"parentUuid":"27bbe6a5-6e97-45af-911c-8a40431b07d4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgNGksAfBsnF4NHVnaWb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Root cause found, and it's decisive.**\n\n| | count |\n|---|---|\n| instances where the gold test file is **in the index** | **3 of 44** |\n| instances with **zero** test-file symbols indexed | 11 (fmt-1683, fmt-2457, fpm, gson-2158, gson-2479, lombok, preact-3010, rubocop, bat, axum, immutable-js) |\n| lucene | **9** test symbols out of **59,681** total |\n| jekyll / django / micropython / framework | 1 / 4 / 4 / 3 |\n\n**The graph index systematically excludes test files.** That is why `COVERING TEST` appears in only 5 of 20 payloads, why the lucene test search returned 0 bytes, and why test-hunting — 39% of all locate ops — is work the graph cannot help with at all. It's not a query problem or a ranking problem. The data isn't there.\n\nLet me confirm where the exclusion happens:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2456,"cache_read_input_tokens":715688,"output_tokens":1264,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2456,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1264,"cache_read_input_tokens":715688,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2456,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2456},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgNGceofVHxfFq9nER3j","type":"assistant","uuid":"cbf9bd1b-dead-43a0-b270-3d381b4d366a","timestamp":"2026-08-03T19:28:51.382Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208",