{"parentUuid":"07d76dd1-f45b-4011-8c19-5a7064c4200c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"38ad7d33-6f2d-41cd-8e8c-1a44118ae431","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QnDprLUMwui3SGpWpkfNG1","type":"tool_result","content":"=== graph_exclude.globs ===\n2:# to all repos — a single pre-registered filter, never per-task). These are test fixtures,\n4:# editing tests), so graphing these only pollutes `symbols`/`def` with noise that crowds out real\n5:# hits (e.g. babel is 95% test-fixture files). Excluding them de-noises graph-query symmetrically.\n6:**/test/**\n7:**/tests/**\n8:**/__tests__/**\n9:**/__fixtures__/**\n10:**/fixtures/**\n11:**/testdata/**\n12:**/test-data/**\n13:**/spec/**\n14:**/specs/**\n15:**/*.test.*\n16:**/*.spec.*\n17:**/*_test.go\n18:**/*_test.py\n19:**/test_*.py\n20:**/*_spec.rb\n21:**/*_test.rb\n22:**/*Test.java\n\n=== is it applied at graph BUILD time? ===\ntools/build_graph.sh:26:# see tools/graph_exclude.globs) so `symbols`/`def` aren't polluted by noise the agent never edits.\ntools/build_graph.sh:28:IGN=\"${GRAPH_IGNORE_FILE:-$SUITE/tools/graph_exclude.globs}\"\n\n=== EG_DROP_TESTS references ===\ntools/run_3arm.sh:136:GQLOG=\"\\${GQLOG:-$out/gq_calls.log}\" EG=\"$EG\" EGI=\"$EGI\" WT=\"$wt\" GSYM=\"$SUITE/graphs/$iid/graph.symbols.ndjson\" GEDGES=\"$SUITE/graphs/$iid/graph.edges.ndjson\" CACHE=\"$SUITE/.eg_cache/$iid\" EG_SEARCH_LEAN=\"${EG_SEARCH_LEAN:-0}\" EG_DROP_TESTS=\"${EG_DROP_TESTS:-0}\" EG_LOCATIONS=\"${EG_LOCATIONS:-0}\" EG_PROFILE=\"${EG_PROFILE:-}\" EG_TIER=\"${EG_TIER:-0}\" EG_SNIPPET=\"${EG_SNIPPET:-6}\" EG_TOPK=\"${EG_TOPK:-10}\" EG_MAXBYTES=\"${EG_MAXBYTES:-16384}\" EG_DEEP=\"${EG_DEEP:-0}\" EG_CALLEES=\"${EG_CALLEES:-0}\" EG_ANCHOR=\"${EG_ANCHOR:-0}\" EG_SIBLINGS=\"${EG_SIBLINGS:-0}\" EG_DEF_ONLY=\"${EG_DEF_ONLY:-0}\" EG_ANCHOR_CONTEXT=\"${EG_ANCHOR_CONTEXT:-6}\" EG_CALLEE_MAXLINES=\"${EG_CALLEE_MAXLINES:-12}\" EG_VERIFY_MODE=\"${EG_VERIFY_MODE:-full}\" EG_MAX_PER_FILE=\"${EG_MAX_PER_FILE:-3}\" EG_TOPK_SHOW=\"${EG_TOPK_SHOW:-10}\" EG_CONF_TIER=\"${EG_CONF_TIER:-0}\" EG_ESCALATE=\"${EG_ESCALATE:-0}\" EG_LITERALS=\"${EG_LITERALS:-0}\" EG_LIT_PER=\"${EG_LIT_PER:-6}\" EG_CONF_GAP=\"${EG_CONF_GAP:-0.008}\" EG_CONF_NARROW=\"${EG_CONF_NARROW:-3}\" GQ_SEARCH_CAP=\"${GQ_SEARCH_CAP:-0}\" EG_EXPLAIN_CMD=\"$([ \"${EG_VERIFY_EXPLAIN:-0}\" = 1 ] && echo \"$gq explain\")\" exec \"$T/eg-q\" \"\\$@\"\ntools/run_3arm.sh:468:  _gdt=\"${GQY_DROP_TESTS:-${EG_DROP_TESTS:-0}}\"\ntools/run_3arm.sh:469:  if [ \"$_gdt\" != \"${EG_DROP_TESTS:-0}\" ] || [ \"$_gdt\" != \"${CMM_DROP_TESTS:-0}\" ]; then\ntools/run_3arm.sh:470:    echo \"[$iid/graphify] ABORT: test-filter mismatch — GQY=$_gdt EG=${EG_DROP_TESTS:-0} CMM=${CMM_DROP_TESTS:-0}.\" >&2\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"98f76653-02c8-4331-b1bb-73cb8cfa1224","timestamp":"2026-08-03T19:28:54.685Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== graph_exclude.globs ===\n2:# to all repos — a single pre-registered filter, never per-task). These are test fixtures,\n4:# editing tests), so graphing these only pollutes `symbols`/`def` with noise that crowds out real\n5:# hits (e.g. babel is 95% test-fixture files). Excluding them de-noises graph-query symmetrically.\n6:**/test/**\n7:**/tests/**\n8:**/__tests__/**\n9:**/__fixtures__/**\n10:**/fixtures/**\n11:**/testdata/**\n12:**/test-data/**\n13:**/spec/**\n14:**/specs/**\n15:**/*.test.*\n16:**/*.spec.*\n17:**/*_test.go\n18:**/*_test.py\n19:**/test_*.py\n20:**/*_spec.rb\n21:**/*_test.rb\n22:**/*Test.java\n\n=== is it applied at graph BUILD time? ===\ntools/build_graph.sh:26:# see tools/graph_exclude.globs) so `symbols`/`def` aren't polluted by noise the agent never edits.\ntools/build_graph.sh:28:IGN=\"${GRAPH_IGNORE_FILE:-$SUITE/tools/graph_exclude.globs}\"\n\n=== EG_DROP_TESTS references ===\ntools/run_3arm.sh:136:GQLOG=\"\\${GQLOG:-$out/gq_calls.log}\" EG=\"$EG\" EGI=\"$EGI\" WT=\"$wt\" GSYM=\"$SUITE/graphs/$iid/graph.symbols.ndjson\" GEDGES=\"$SUITE/graphs/$iid/graph.edges.ndjson\" CACHE=\"$SUITE/.eg_cache/$iid\" EG_SEARCH_LEAN=\"${EG_SEARCH_LEAN:-0}\" EG_DROP_TESTS=\"${EG_DROP_TESTS:-0}\" EG_LOCATIONS=\"${EG_LOCATIONS:-0}\" EG_PROFILE=\"${EG_PROFILE:-}\" EG_TIER=\"${EG_TIER:-0}\" EG_SNIPPET=\"${EG_SNIPPET:-6}\" EG_TOPK=\"${EG_TOPK:-10}\" EG_MAXBYTES=\"${EG_MAXBYTES:-16384}\" EG_DEEP=\"${EG_DEEP:-0}\" EG_CALLEES=\"${EG_CALLEES:-0}\" EG_ANCHOR=\"${EG_ANCHOR:-0}\" EG_SIBLINGS=\"${EG_SIBLINGS:-0}\" EG_DEF_ONLY=\"${EG_DEF_ONLY:-0}\" EG_ANCHOR_CONTEXT=\"${EG_ANCHOR_CONTEXT:-6}\" EG_CALLEE_MAXLINES=\"${EG_CALLEE_MAXLINES:-12}\" EG_VERIFY_MODE=\"${EG_VERIFY_MODE:-full}\" EG_MAX_PER_FILE=\"${EG_MAX_PER_FILE:-3}\" EG_TOPK_SHOW=\"${EG_TOPK_SHOW:-10}\" EG_CONF_TIER=\"${EG_CONF_TIER:-0}\" EG_ESCALATE=\"${EG_ESCALATE:-0}\" EG_LITERALS=\"${EG_LITERALS:-0}\" EG_LIT_PER=\"${EG_LIT_PER:-6}\" EG_CONF_GAP=\"${EG_CONF_GAP:-0.008}\" EG_CONF_NARROW=\"${EG_CONF_NARROW:-3}\" GQ_SEARCH_CAP=\"${GQ_SEARCH_CAP:-0}\" EG_EXPLAIN_CMD=\"$([ \"${EG_VERIFY_EXPLAIN:-0}\" = 1 ] && echo \"$gq explain\")\" exec \"$T/eg-q\" \"\\$@\"\ntools/run_3arm.sh:468:  _gdt=\"${GQY_DROP_TESTS:-${EG_DROP_TESTS:-0}}\"\ntools/run_3arm.sh:469:  if [ \"$_gdt\" != \"${EG_DROP_TESTS:-0}\" ] || [ \"$_gdt\" != \"${CMM_DROP_TESTS:-0}\" ]; then\ntools/run_3arm.sh:470:    echo \"[$iid/graphify] ABORT: test-filter mismatch — GQY=$_gdt EG=${EG_DROP_TESTS:-0} CMM=${CMM_DROP_TESTS:-0}.\" >&2","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"07d76dd1-f45b-4011-8c19-5a7064c4200c","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
{"parentUuid":"98f76653-02c8-4331-b1bb-73cb8cfa1224","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgNJEBWGDf3untvhu42G","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2880,"cache_read_input_tokens":718144,"output_tokens":1542,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2880,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1542,"cache_read_input_tokens":718144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2880,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2880},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgNJ52bBmW4LEkHQ863x","type":"assistant","uuid":"214ebf38-5843-4c59-a4a9-31c3f6b92b18","timestamp":"2026-08-03T19:29:13.806Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
{"parentUuid":"214ebf38-5843-4c59-a4a9-31c3f6b92b18","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgNJEBWGDf3untvhu42G","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Confirmed — and it's a deliberate design decision that backfired.** `tools/graph_exclude.globs`, applied at graph **build** time (`build_graph.sh:28`), excludes:\n\n```\n**/test/**  **/tests/**  **/__tests__/**  **/fixtures/**  **/testdata/**\n**/spec/**  **/*.test.*  **/*.spec.*  **/*_test.go  **/*_test.py\n**/test_*.py  **/*_spec.rb  **/*_test.rb  **/*Test.java\n```\n\nWith this rationale in the file: *\"the agent never edits tests, so graphing these only pollutes `symbols`/`def` with noise that crowds out real hits (e.g. babel is 95% test-fixture files).\"*\n\nThat premise is half right. The agent doesn't **edit** tests — the prompt forbids it. But it very much needs to **read** them, to understand expected behaviour and to model the reproduce script step 2 demands. So the de-noising removed the graph's ability to answer the single largest locate question, which is now 39% of all locate ops.\n\nAnd the renderer already anticipates indexed tests — `partitionSearchSections` has a `SearchSectionCoveringTest` and a `tests` partition. Those sections are starved because the data never gets built.\n\nLet me test the fix on the cleanest case — fmt-2457, currently **0** test symbols, gold test `test/ranges-test.cc`:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2880,"cache_read_input_tokens":718144,"output_tokens":1542,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2880,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1542,"cache_read_input_tokens":718144,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2880,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2880},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgNJ52bBmW4LEkHQ863x","type":"assistant","uuid":"b43834a6-1b0f-47d1-8d34-a0084e140125","timestamp":"2026-08-03T19:29:19.048Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
