{"parentUuid":"34782f28-702f-4137-a706-ae2304272b7f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgNuCMbbHQK9w1TDcKcK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01X4M62ahqD2p6K3Yo38GVpd","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/graphmark-bench/agentic-swebench\necho \"load=$(pgrep -f 'claude -p'|wc -l|tr -d ' ')  r30 fin=$(grep -c fin /tmp/mcptest/r30.log)/60\"\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport json,glob,os,sys\nsys.path.insert(0,'tools')\nfrom model_cmp import load, geo, boot\nb,e=load('R30PUB_r1_baseline','baseline'),load('R30PUB_r1_eg','eg')\ni=sorted(set(b)&set(e))\nprint(f'  dirs base {len(glob.glob(\"results/R30PUB_r1_baseline/baseline/*/\"))}/30  eg {len(glob.glob(\"results/R30PUB_r1_eg/eg/*/\"))}/30   gated pairs {len(i)}')\nif i:\n    rs=[e[x]['tot']/b[x]['tot'] for x in i]; lo,hi=boot(rs)\n    print(f'  TOKENS n={len(i)}  {geo(rs)*100:+.1f}%  CI [{lo:+.1f},{hi:+.1f}]  winners {sum(1 for r in rs if r<1)}/{len(i)}')\n    for x in sorted(i,key=lambda z:e[z]['tot']/b[z]['tot']):\n        print(f'    {(e[x][\"tot\"]/b[x][\"tot\"]-1)*100:+7.0f}%  {x.split(\"__\")[1]}')\nPY\necho\necho \"=== the break-even law applied to the two instance sets (baseline ops, PUB cell) ===\"\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport json,glob,os,re,sys\nsys.path.insert(0,'tools')\nfrom model_cmp import load\nPROJ=os.path.expanduser('~/.claude/projects')\nLOC=re.compile(r'\\b(grep|rg|find|ls|cat|sed -n|awk|head|tail)\\b')\ndef ops(tag,arm,inst):\n    d=f'results/{tag}/{arm}/{inst}/'\n    cc=d+'cc_out.json'\n    if not os.path.exists(cc): return None\n    try: s=json.load(open(cc)).get('session_id')\n    except Exception: return None\n    g=glob.glob(f'{PROJ}/*/{s}.jsonl')\n    if not g: return None\n    n=0\n    for ln in open(g[0],errors='ignore'):\n        try: r=json.loads(ln)\n        except Exception: continue\n        if r.get('type')!='assistant': continue\n        for c in ((r.get('message') or {}).get('content') or []):\n            if isinstance(c,dict) and c.get('type')=='tool_use': n+=1\n    return n\nb,e=load('PUB_r1_baseline','baseline'),load('PUB_r1_eg','eg')\ninst=sorted(set(b)&set(e))\nabove=below=0\nprint(f\"  {'instance':<24}{'base ops':>9}{'>34.4?':>8}{'tokens':>9}  predicted / actual\")\nfor x in inst:\n    o=ops('PUB_r1_baseline','baseline',x)\n    if o is None: continue\n    r=(e[x]['tot']/b[x]['tot']-1)*100\n    hi=o>34.4\n    ok='OK ' if (hi==(r<0)) else 'MISS'\n    above+=hi; below+= (not hi)\n    print(f'  {x.split(\"__\")[1]:<24}{o:>9}{\"yes\" if hi else \"no\":>8}{r:>+8.0f}%  {ok}')\nprint(f'\\n  above break-even: {above}/{above+below}')\nPY","description":"rep30 progress and break-even law check"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2661,"cache_read_input_tokens":749060,"output_tokens":1337,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2661,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1337,"cache_read_input_tokens":749060,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2661,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2661},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgNu43mxgvZYRjpsmwXF","type":"assistant","uuid":"819bc1d9-2f9c-4dfe-b0f9-310113d9f754","timestamp":"2026-08-03T19:37:08.204Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
