 x 9.6% = 19% tokens per loser\n    3 calls x 9.6% = 29% tokens per loser\n    4 calls x 9.6% = 38% tokens per loser\n\nROUTE B — my measured category decomposition of where the loser overrun actually sits\n  pooled loser overrun = +76 ops. Category shares (from the paired comparison):\n    EXEC     32.9%    25.0 ops\n    READ     25.0%    19.0 ops\n    EDIT     19.7%    15.0 ops\n    LOCATE   14.5%    11.0 ops\n    GIT       5.3%     4.0 ops\n    SCRIPT    3.9%     3.0 ops\n  aim fixes target LOCATE only -> 14.5% of 76 = 11.0 ops across 8 losers = 1.4 ops/loser\n\n  converting via tokens = ops^1.207 (R2=0.916, confirmed out of sample on rep30):\n     1.4 ops off eg's 44.0 -> op ratio 0.968 -> tokens -3.8% per loser\n     3.0 ops off eg's 44.0 -> op ratio 0.932 -> tokens -8.2% per loser\n     6.0 ops off eg's 44.0 -> op ratio 0.864 -> tokens -16.2% per loser\n\nEFFECT ON THE 20-INSTANCE GEOMEAN (12 winners ln-sum -5.369, 8 losers +2.996):\n  Route B, 1.4 ops (-4.1%/loser)     geomean -> -12.7%\n  mid, 3 ops (-8.6%)                 geomean -> -14.3%\n  Route A, 3 calls (-29%)            geomean -> -22.6%\n\n  goal = -25.0%   current = -11.2%","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"45f47d60-ffac-4c12-8147-032ebe2aa938","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
