{"parentUuid":"3c3a991a-5755-44c8-a0c3-f8567697699c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgQJSFmdg7vgKZA7NA1a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Update — 20 of 60 done. rep30 has fallen back to −13.9% and the CI reopened.**\n\n| gated pairs | tokens | CI | winners |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 4 | −40.9% | [−55.1, −21.2] | 4/4 |\n| 8 | −24.6% | [−42.7, −0.9] | 6/8 |\n| **10** | **−13.9%** | **[−35.3, +13.2]** | **6/10** |\n\nThe two new pairs were both losses — fluentd +45%, fmt-2457 +46% — and they took it from the goal line back to roughly where the 20-instance cell sits. So the −40.9% and −24.6% I reported were small-n artefacts, exactly the pattern that has caught me repeatedly today. I should have weighted them lower in how I described them.\n\nThe ops table tracks it faithfully:\n\n| arm | pre | post | build | TOTAL |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| baseline | 13.6 | 9.4 | 6.4 | **29.4** |\n| eg | 14.1 | 8.0 | 5.4 | **27.5** |\n\nops −6.5%, and the law predicts −7.7% tokens from that. Measured is −13.9%, so the law is running ~6 points optimistic here — within the noise at n=10 but worth watching.\n\nAnd **pre-edit is +3.7% again** — the fifth consecutive cell where the graph does not reduce locate-before-editing on Opus. The baseline's total is 29.4 ops, *below* the 34.4 break-even, which is precisely why this cell is marginal: rep30's baselines are less wasteful than I assumed from the older cells.\n\nTwo notes on fmt-2457 specifically: it's +46% here versus −18% on the official 20, and the catastrophe workflow established that its swings are **132% baseline-side** — eg's own cost barely moves while the baseline collapses or balloons depending on whether it runs a two-compiler matrix. So that instance contributes mostly noise to any cell it's in.\n\n40 jobs left. I'll report the completed cell rather than any further interim, since the interims have been actively misleading."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1862,"cache_read_input_tokens":791342,"output_tokens":718,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1862,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":718,"cache_read_input_tokens":791342,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1862,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1862},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgQJKtY8dsLHbjZtguC1","type":"assistant","uuid":"08e3ef8f-8a7f-4848-9969-a430e1a34b9f","timestamp":"2026-08-03T19:55:27.034Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
