 doc                    HANDOFF-OPUS-TOKENS.md (213 lines)\n  config bundle                  handoff-config/ (7 files)\n  eg-consolidated                clean @ 024f25a (stable/eg-agent-fixes)\n  entire-graph                   clean @ afd5a1c (test/all-agent-fixes), 4 stashes preserved\n  processes running              0","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"bca29b85-8f54-4006-9eb7-d3e2bd39c30f","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
{"parentUuid":"e9f3d9cd-8df0-4aa7-9009-928e09a67bf3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgRPb5bMASaCbUrBATDh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Clean slate, everything landed on branch **`opus-token-handoff`** (`ed21139`).\n\n**What's in it for the next agent:**\n\n`HANDOFF-OPUS-TOKENS.md` — 213 lines, organised so it can be acted on rather than read:\n\n1. **The config and the number** — `PUBLISHED_EXACT=1`, Opus, cap 120: **−11.2% CI [−27.8, +9.6], n=20**. Goal was −25%, not met.\n2. **All 7 configurations measured**, with baseline ops, eg ops, session size and tokens — including why `OFF`'s −46.5% is invalid (a flag checked in one dispatcher but not the one every cell uses).\n3. **Two fitted laws** so the next person can predict before spending: `eg_ops = 14.16 + 0.588·base_ops` (break-even 34.4; eg's own op count is flat between winners and losers at p=0.97 while the baseline's decides at p=0.0069), and `tokens = ops^1.207` (R²=0.916, confirmed out of sample).\n4. **The one confirmed untried lever** — aim. Gold **file** coverage 9/9 = 100%, gold **line** coverage ~0%, with the per-instance table showing lucene's gold at 148 while the payload prints 34-36, 27, 181-188, 118-124 around it. Root cause verified in source at `search_related.go:41` and `:62`. Plus the open sizing question and the exact discriminator to settle it.\n5. **Integrity fixes required before any number is quotable** — netjail blocks curl/wget but not npm/pip/composer/go/cargo, with three confirmed answer leaks documented per-instance, one of them inside a −38% \"winner\".\n6. **13 refuted mechanisms**, each with the winner-control number that killed it, so nobody re-runs them.\n7. **Reproduce commands and non-negotiables** — including that partial cells lie (rep30 read −40.9% at n=4 and −16.5% at n=14) and that `xargs -P -I{}` plus zsh word-splitting cost two wasted launches.\n\n`handoff-config/` has the working config: `pubworker.sh` (the −11.2% config), `s1worker.sh` (same plus the cache isolation to copy in), `launch.sh`, `linecov.py` for the aim measurement, the jobs file and the instance set.\n\nTwo honest notes. `entire-graph/TOKEN-ACCURACY-PLAN.md` is the better document on the aim defect and I've cross-referenced it with two corrections — its step-2 branch gate is cleared, and its 32.4%/58.3% split doesn't reproduce here (I get ~0% for both, which makes the defect larger but its sizing argument weaker). And I left `_egsearch.py` and the other `_eg*.py` helpers uncommitted because they were dirty before this session started and aren't mine to land."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1629,"cache_read_input_tokens":820708,"output_tokens":976,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1629,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":976,"cache_read_input_tokens":820708,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1629,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1629},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgRPSuiDuum6XeEP6urk","type":"assistant","uuid":"2facb037-44a9-42ef-a1c1-2511bd5024f6","timestamp":"2026-08-03T20:09:49.120Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
