{"parentUuid":"1cfc8de7-6022-496e-936e-3e033272f314","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgRSJvaPyS4u1BTZ75Us","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Update — everything is landed and idle. Nothing running.**\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| branch | `opus-token-handoff` @ `ed21139` (2 commits) |\n| processes / background tasks | 0 / 0 |\n| handoff doc | `HANDOFF-OPUS-TOKENS.md`, 213 lines |\n| config bundle | `handoff-config/` — 7 files |\n| working repos | `eg-consolidated` clean @ `024f25a`; `entire-graph` clean @ `afd5a1c`, 4 stashes preserved |\n\n**The two numbers on record:**\n\n| cell | n | tokens | CI | winners |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| PUB, 20-instance official — **complete** | 20/20 | **−11.2%** | [−27.8, +9.6] | 12/20 |\n| R30PUB, rep30 — **partial, killed** | 14/30 | −16.5% | [−32.7, +3.9] | 9/14 |\n\n**Goal not met.** −11.2% against a −25% target on the sample the goal named. The rep30 cell is labelled partial in the handoff and shouldn't be quoted — it read −40.9% at n=4 and −16.5% at n=14, which is the clearest illustration of why partial cells mislead.\n\nNothing further is in flight, so there's no new measurement to report. The next agent has the config that produces −11.2%, the two fitted laws to predict with, 13 refuted mechanisms with the control that killed each, three documented answer leaks that must be closed before any number is quotable, and the one confirmed untried lever — aim, at 100% file coverage and ~0% line coverage — plus the free offline discriminator to size it."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1149,"cache_read_input_tokens":823316,"output_tokens":571,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1149,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens