{"parentUuid":"b8b3983f-6f1c-4e99-bebe-3d88d003e945","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgScdKWs1cBMpk2CZ7ZC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Update — 8 of 30 resume jobs done. n=18/30 gated: −21.6% [−39.0, −2.0], winners 11/18.**\n\nThe 18th pair was a loss (terraform, which landed since the last check), taking it from −22.9% to −21.6%. CI still excludes zero.\n\n12 instances left, and the state map shows why it'll take a while — most have neither arm complete yet:\n\n| instance | arms done |\n|---|---|\n| immutable-js-2006 | eg only |\n| preact-3010 | baseline only |\n| phpspreadsheet-4214, lombok-3486, pylint-7080, redis-10095, rubocop-13680, scikit-learn-14629, bat-2260, axum-1119, valkey-1499, core-11870 | **neither** |\n\nTwo of those are ones I'd expect to lose on prior evidence — **redis-10095 has lost in all four configs it has appeared in** (+65%, +2%, +39%, +13%), and preact-3010 and lombok-3486 both lost under FRUGAL (+23%, +88%). So the remaining set is loser-weighted relative to what's already in, and I'd expect the geomean to drift up rather than down as they land.\n\nLoad 10, zero bad jobs, waiter armed. Artifact goes together once all 30 are in."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1155,"cache_read_input_tokens":844029,"output_tokens":435,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1155,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":435,"cache_read_input_tokens":844029,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1155,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1155},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgScWNZEFTCuz7Lbg5fa","type":"assistant","uuid":"e662327a-23f3-48f9-af7e-