{"parentUuid":"17b3fd82-1129-4d3f-bf96-1e7b0b53b614","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgZ94zPTWGrZcGMkCteh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**rep30 is complete. All 30 pairs gated.**\n\nbat-2260's eg arm finished cleanly — `subtype=success`, 57 turns, $4.28 — and landed as a win, taking winners to 18/30.\n\n**Final: rep30 geomean −14.4%, CI [−28.9, +3.1], 30/30 pairs, winners 18/30.**\n\nThat's within 0.1 of the n=29 figure the artifact and handoff were built on, so both stand as published without correction.\n\n**The two complete cells:**\n\n| cell | n | geomean | CI | winners |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 20-instance official | 20/20 | −11.2% | [−27.8, +9.6] | 12/20 |\n| rep30 | **30/30** | **−14.4%** | [−28.9, +3.1] | 18/30 |\n\nTarget −25%. Not reached in either. Two independently sampled cells, both complete, agreeing within ~3 points — which is the most defensible thing to come out of the day.\n\nNothing is running. Load 0, no launchers. Everything is on branch `opus-token-handoff` @ `ed21139`, the artifact is published, and the continuation prompt is in place.\n\nLet me update the handoff with the final figure so the next agent doesn't inherit the partial:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":825,"cache_read_input_tokens":883531,"output_tokens":1251,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":825,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1251,"cache_read_input_tokens":883531,"cache_creation_input_tokens":825,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":825},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgZ8v9aAVrNCLfn2PcQk","type":"assistant","uuid":"999420e1-9ecc-4759-9b80-299