{"parentUuid":"cdb2afb2-cc1b-4712-b858-d3e535e0d055","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdgZAST136sYzXSJoqMfd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Everything is complete and committed.**\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| branch | `opus-token-handoff` @ `41b90b2` (3 commits) |\n| handoff | `HANDOFF-OPUS-TOKENS.md` — updated with the final rep30 figure |\n| config | `handoff-config/` — 7 files |\n| artifact | [published](https://claude.ai/code/artifact/d16079e5-7734-46b0-b7a4-a61e9845c7d0) |\n| running | nothing — load 0 |\n\n**Final results, both cells complete:**\n\n| cell | n | geomean | CI | winners |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 20-instance official | 20/20 | **−11.2%** | [−27.8, +9.6] | 12/20 |\n| rep30 | 30/30 | **−14.4%** | [−28.9, +3.1] | 18/30 |\n\nGoal was −25%. **Not met**, and I've written that at the top of the handoff rather than burying it.\n\nSpend: 0.64B tokens, 361 sessions, ~$560 — of which $175 went to the OFF cells that turned out invalid on prompt asymmetry.\n\nWhat the next agent inherits that I didn't have this morning: a measurement that's actually symmetric (verified on emitted prompts, not config), two cells that agree, two fitted laws that predict a change's worth before you spend on it, twelve refuted mechanisms with the winner-control that killed each, three documented answer leaks to close first, and one confirmed defect — gold file coverage 9/9, gold line coverage ~0% — root-caused to two specific lines in `search_related.go` and never attempted."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5615,"cache_read_input_tokens":884356,"output_tokens":554,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5615,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":554,"cache_read_input_tokens":884356,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5615,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5615},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdgZAHYy8zz5zWwN5HFbk","type":"assistant","uuid":"24634b5f-1beb-417e-be2c-03eeabb22d49","timestamp":"2026-08-03T21:51:38.146Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"modular-cooking-cupcake"}
